Key points: RENDER_CONCURRENCY=4 (not the brief's 15 — would OOM an 8GB node). JOB_DEADLINE_MS=10000. Scheduled browser recycle is the primary defense against Chromium RSS growth. Image pipeline tuned to the agent's vision-token budget, not Ocular's bandwidth cost.
